    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a kind thing to say... Dorothy did seem peaceful, at the end. her daughter told me she just went in her sleep. i think about that sometimes, when i'm lying awake at night. \n\nmy children worry too much, i think. they'd want me to see doctors and talk to people but i feel like... i've done all that living already. does that make sense? i'm not sad exactly, just... finished, maybe. like a book that's come to its last page.",
